{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "797b06fd14718ae00037dd8077016f39bd4def4b4365a70f17ce4f8b2c0f4c52", "ja": "（あずささんが出演したファンタジードラマの試写\nイベントが終了した。観客の評判は上々のようだ！）", "zh": "（梓小姐参与演出的奇幻电视剧试映会结束了，\n观众的反应似乎很好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "e41c326ebc7dd9325942192a25b4e5d87a29a0958125ba549adc76739bb85752", "ja": "ふふっ、すごかったですね。どういうお話かは\n知っているのに、ずっとハラハラしてしまいました～。", "zh": "呵呵，好精彩喔。我明明知道故事内容，\n却还是跟着剧情从头紧张到尾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4f59a76fa24f50b8e2b6ac5a2ee51b3fd392f5a2c199ea2bef20aa61b68eba7d", "ja": "たしかに面白いドラマでしたね。観客の評判も\n良かったですし、今から放送が楽しみです。", "zh": "这部电视剧的确很有意思呢。\n而且观众的反应也很好，我已经开始期待播出了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "4941b45d03e7709706860e164bd75805bd425f12f475e44e648c9fa0c813727a", "ja": "ふふっ、頑張って演じた甲斐がありました。あの役には\n思い入れがありましたから、とっても嬉しいです♪", "zh": "呵呵，我努力演戏有所回报了。\n我对那个角色投入了不少心力，所以很高兴♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5d7e59097d76fc8199b5e931cb3c01ac67acd805fb564a6ab03d4c2067988129", "ja": "あずささんの役というと……孤独に耐えきれず、\n魔女となってしまう賢者の役でしたよね。", "zh": "梓小姐饰演的角色是……无法忍受孤独，\n结果变成魔女的贤者，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "a6027075fd88b35342a771860e3ab9746a216eab295e8ffcd5ae5674296a9887", "ja": "はい。あの人の気持ちが、\nちょっぴりわかる気がするんです。", "zh": "是的，我觉得我有点能体会\n那个角色的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "10a641e76023ebd8ef5288f465b34d32b2d18c087587e64f402f66e3d288f32f", "ja": "ドラマほど大げさではないですけど、私も時々、\n急にひとりがさみしいなって思うときはあって……。", "zh": "虽然不像电视剧那么夸张，\n但我有时也会突然觉得一个人很寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6ec55f39697d3cee0ddc84ba9c80ba14ee7e5f87da9f3a60397c6f3fbd10c9ea", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　何か悩みがあるなら、\n遠慮しないで言ってもらえると……。", "zh": "咦，真的吗？如果你有什么烦恼，\n希望你不要客气，都可以跟我说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "586b1705e8bad1a2efc5d0fb8154fd1e9dac68e3c79abac0c2393893c1169411", "ja": "あっ。すみません、悩みというほどのことでは。\nただ、ふとそう思う時があるだけで……。", "zh": "啊、不是的，并没有到烦恼那么严重。\n只是有时会突然这么想而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "3544a624dcd3edd9b420ea5ca71fbb95e806262019fd55ecb0c98ae605d0820e", "ja": "私は、素敵な仲間に囲まれていますし、理解してくれる\n人も応援してくれる人も、たくさんいますから。", "zh": "毕竟我身边有很棒的伙伴，\n也有很多理解我、支持我的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "c067f233fd837a80086d10cad4b2b66db368a6050059fa0387ef9526cf423a0c", "ja": "でも……だからこそ、こわくなってしまうのかも。\nひとりになったらどうしよう、って。", "zh": "不过……或许就是因为这样，才会感到害怕吧。\n害怕自己如果变成孤单一人的话，该怎么办才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1011_p", "source_sha256": "79744ea57e604f2684e00a43e86132564e20fe562275f853af1332fc86b544ef", "ja": "……なるほど。たしかに、失うことがこわくなる\n瞬間は、たまにあるかもしれませんね。", "zh": "原来如此……的确，偶尔会有一瞬间，\n心中会出现害怕失去的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "59dd1f346b9d4c831a3f0d8a5fa901c18464a9f5343424a2ccba580490f8b5f3", "ja": "はい。私の演じた賢者も、支えてくれる人がそばに\nいたら、闇に堕ちることもなかったと思いますし。", "zh": "是的，我饰演的那个贤者，如果她身边\n有人支持她的话，她应该也不会堕入黑暗了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1013_p", "source_sha256": "08367f8d71b207cd108b1148db2ecbacc5ef6c48e4d27f524c22e3dd2542b447", "ja": "そうですね。でも今回のお話でも、最後は莉緒の演じる\nエルフが陰ながら支えていた……ってお話でしたし。", "zh": "对啊，不过这次的故事，最后也是有\n莉绪饰演的精灵在背后默默支持她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1014_p", "source_sha256": "aefcd5bff7fe6522a44249c65b65cc9788dc8b82fe5f8c0e621598899834b5d8", "ja": "じつは、大事に思ってくれる人が近くにいても、\nなかなか気づけないだけなのかもしれません。", "zh": "或许只是她一直没发现……\n重视她的人其实就在她身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "93b2165b9bbe0046e8b123ada146973ca3a0654ee88c451f2900f049e8a7880a", "ja": "……まあ、そうかもしれませんね♪　そばにいるのが\n当たり前になっているから気づけない、そんな……。", "zh": "嗯……或许是这样呢♪因为已经觉得对方待在身边\n是理所当然的，所以没发现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "6e93cce42ddb2f6e92f0bc8b5b1262bc606884b10ccd404cf39b122f8e20b50b", "ja": "そんな……、大切な人……。\nあっ……。", "zh": "没发现……重要的人就在……\n啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3de7434db532a6c980eb2b2e6c7c043e6eecdd0fb6b1ad39d983b43625cdb995", "ja": "……あの、あずささん？　なにか、見つめられている\n気がしますけど……。お、俺の顔に、何かついてます？", "zh": "呃……梓小姐？你好像一直盯着我看……\n请、请问我脸上有什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "3fd6bac1d848661262bee2057f36ae7d467ed68a48299c8fa974c7b89a1ac6a8", "ja": "あの……、\n{$P$}さん……？", "zh": "那个……\n{$P$}先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1019_p", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "774e6e882d4288e0a49c733d50227fb56691982039d2c73161c51fe76313ace8", "ja": "口元に、ゴハンつぶが……。", "zh": "你的嘴角有饭粒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e1115493fa43169ab392fb1ab171e9ce34cfcbcfa3bddcb58f402a818c23d48b", "ja": "うわあっ、本当に何かついてたわけですね！？\nす、すみません……、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "呜哇！还真的有东西啊！？\n不、不好意思……谢谢你的提醒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "2c0130b8530d8fe0cfd754d1a05d47ca1f582595b79469fead698de57193160a", "ja": "どういたしまして♪\nそれじゃ、そろそろ戻りましょうか。", "zh": "不客气♪\n那么也差不多该回去了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0133_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "dacd80ef2959021bf13b0276084d77bbb51f1cc00ef6955c7d76c1a9eaf3024c", "ja": "私の……。私達の、大切な劇場に！\nうふふっ♪", "zh": "回去我……我们重要的剧场！\n唔呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
